    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the serrano ham and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the soy sauce, fish sauce, and lime juice to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and stir to combine with the sauce and ham mixture.",
